## `fundere`: si un embed es `Drop`, el host también lo es (move-only) y su
## cleanup compone: campos propios en orden inverso y luego los embeds en orden
## inverso de `fundere`. `GameObj` es solo `Nexus`: el host no se vuelve `Drop`
## por él, pero sí tiene cleanup.
import std.spark

rune GameObj:
    position as int
    label as string

rune Physics derive Drop:
    velocity as int
    note as string

rune Enemy fundere GameObj, Physics:
    health as int
    notes as string

weave main into int:
    var e as Enemy is with gameObj is (with position is 1, label is "g"), physics is (with velocity is 2, note is "p"), health is 3, notes is "n"
    var c as Enemy is calling e.clone
    set c.health is 4
    calling spark.println with "{c.health},{e.health},{c.velocity}"
    return 0
